WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.798
Select a site and choose Track to design

2
00:00:02.891 --> 00:00:04.180
a rail alignment.

3
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:07.528
Choose the design speed. This sets the minimum

4
00:00:07.598 --> 00:00:09.549
curve radius for the alignment.

5
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.104
Draw the route with clicks, then choose Finish.

6
00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.474
Tilt and rotate the 3D view to inspect

7
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.947
the track alignment in its surroundings.
